|content1=
*August 19th - '''Entropiq''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' by signing the roster of [[Projekt F]] consisting of [[leckr]], [[capseN]], [[AJTT]], [[daxen]], [[HONES]], and [[forji]] as coach. <ref name="PF">{{cite web|url=https://www.entropiq.gg/blog/entropiq-joins-cs-go-world-with-leckr-at-helm|title=Entropiq Joins CS:GO World With Leckr at Helm|date=2020-08-19|publisher='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 19th - '''Entropiq''' replace [[daxen]] with [[MoriiSko]]. <ref name="-daxen">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/Entropiqteam/posts/251205646434387|title=Dnes se oficiálně loučíme s Zdeněk "daxen" Dušek z týmu CS:GO|language={{Flag|cz}} Czech|trans_title=Today we are officially saying goodbye to Zdeněk "daxen" Dušek from the CS:GO team|date=2021-01-19|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref><ref name="+Mori">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/Entropiqteam/posts/251143846440567|title=Welcome in our world Josef "MoriiSko" Maurenc|date=2021-01-19|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*February 5th - '''Entropiq''' replace [[forji]] with [[d0di]]. <ref name="+d0di">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/Entropiqteam/posts/260912785463673|title=Do nové sezóny přicházíme s novým CS:GO trenérem Jozef "d0di" Kiss|language={{Flag|cz}} Czech|trans_title=We are coming to the new season with the new CS:GO coach Jozef "d0di" Kiss|date=2021-02-05|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*May 10th - '''Entropiq''' transfer their [[:Category:Czech Republic|Czech]] roster to [[Entropiq Prague]], a newly-formed division. They sign the roster of [[EPG Family]], consisting of [[El1an]], [[Lack1]], [[NickelBack]], [[Krad]], [[Forester]], and [[hooch]], the head coach. Additionally, [[XomA]] and [[Dart]] are signed as assistant coach and manager, respectively. <ref name="EP">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1391754909981229058|title=Although the name changes, the team remains|date=2021-05-10|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref><ref name="EPG">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1391793366334152705|title=As of today, Entropiq becomes the 21st best team in the #CSGO world rankings|date=2021-05-10|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>

|content3=
*June 8th - '''Entropiq''' bench [[Lack1]] and acquire [[mir]] from [[Team Spirit]] as his replacement. <ref name="+mir">{{cite web|url=https://www.entropiq.gg/blog/change-in-the-international-cs-go-team-roster|title=Changes in the international CS:GO team roster|date=2022-06-08|publisher='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*July 11th - '''Entropiq''' release [[Lack1]]. <ref name="-Lack1">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1546562465651052545|title=Thank you for shaping our world @Lack1csgo|date=2022-07-11|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*September 15th - '''Entropiq''' transfer-list [[El1an]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="El1an transfer">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1570417741735272449|title=After a mutual agreement, @El1anCSGO has been transfer-listed|date=2022-09-15|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*October 13th - '''Entropiq''' transfer-list their lineup, however they will continue to actively compete until their contracts expire. <ref name="entropiq transfer list">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/34808/entropiq-transfer-list-main-roster|title=Entropiq transfer list main roster|date=2022-10-13|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[GSTK]]}}</ref>
*November 12th - '''Entropiq''' release [[NickelBack]], [[mir]], [[Krad]], [[El1an]], and [[XomA]]. <ref name="Nov 2022">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1591402957156896768|title=Nickelback, mir, Krad, El1an & Assistant coach XomA becomes free agents|date=2022-11-12|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>

|content4=
*January 10th - '''Entropiq''' part ways with [[hooch]]. <ref name="-hooch">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1612811626230464513|title=Today marks the end of our journey together with @hoochR|date=2023-01-10|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*February 1st - '''Entropiq''' reveal their new roster consisting of [[AJTT]], [[MoriiSko]], [[Rutk0]], [[red (German player)|red]], [[snatchie]] and [[Loord]], with the latter joining as coach. <ref name="EIQ23">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1620839416527978497|title=Our long-awaited CS:GO line-up is here!|date=2023-02-01|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*February 10th - [[Forester]] is acquired by [[1win]]. <ref name="-Forester">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1624049295891787776|title=Today marks the end of our journey with @Forester_cs|date=2023-02-10|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*April 21st - '''Entropiq''' bench [[MoriiSko]] and part ways with [[Rutk0]]. <ref name="-Rutk0">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1649385310374047745|title=1/2 It has been clear for some time that we would enter the spring season with a revamped CS:GO lineup|date=2023-04-21|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*April 28th - '''Entropiq''' sign [[PlesseN]] and [[ritchiEE]]. <ref name="+PlesseN ritchiE">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1651984174339817472|title=We're glad to welcome two new CS:GO players!|date=2023-04-28|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*June 1st - '''Entropiq''' release [[MoriiSko]]. <ref name="-Morii">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1664332724834906112|title=Vyhráli jsme spolu COOL Ligu a skoro vyhráli eLEAGUE|language={{Flag|cz}} Czech|trans_title=We've won COOL League and almost won eLEAGUE together|date=2023-06-01|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*June 19th - '''Entropiq''' bench and transfer-list their roster. <ref name="bench23">{{cite web|url=https://www.entropiq.gg/blog/news-in-the-entropiq-csgo-division|title=News in the Entropiq CS:GO division|date=2023-06-19|publisher='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*June 30th - '''Entropiq''' release [[Loord]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-Loord">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/LoordBb/status/1670758116839895041|title=At the end of the month my contract with @Entropiqteam expires|date=2023-06-19|author=[[Loord]]}}</ref>
*July 5th - '''Entropiq''' acquire [[forsyy]] from [[SINNERS Esports]]. <ref name="+forsyy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1676637194117677089|title=We’ve got some news for you all|date=2023-07-05|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*July 28th - '''Entropiq''' sign [[tiziaN]], [[c0llins]], [[Oxygen]], [[Marix]] and [[enkay J]], the latter as coach. <ref name="J28">{{cite web|url=https://www.entropiq.gg/blog/new-era-for-entropiq-counter-strike/|title=New Era for Entropiq Counter-Strike|date=2023-07-28|publisher='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*August 21st - '''Entropiq''' release [[AJTT]], [[red (German player)|red]] and [[snatchie]] upon the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="ajtt fa">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Ajtt_cs/status/1693523163194208416|title=As of today I am no longer part of @Entropiqteam|date=2023-08-21|author=[[AJTT]]}}</ref><ref name="-red">{{inside source|date=2023-09-06|source=red}}</ref><ref name="-snatchie">{{inside source|date=2023-10-31|source=snatchie}}</ref>
*September 1st - '''Entropiq''' part ways with [[ritchiEE]]. <ref name="-ritchiEE">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ritchiEEcsgo/status/1697594344214073503|title=Now officially a free agent!|date=2023-09-01|author=[[ritchiEE]]}}</ref>
*September 28th - [[PlesseN]] is acquired by [[Alliance]]. <ref name="-PlesseN">{{cite web|url=https://thealliance.gg/alliance-x-cs2/|title=Alliance x CS2|date=2023-09-28|author=[[Kelly Ong]]|publisher=[[Alliance]]}}</ref>
*December 15th - [[forsyy]] is acquired by [[Dynamo Eclot]]. <ref name="-forsyy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1735706366252102001|title=It was a short but intensive run but sometimes things don’t work out as planned|date=2023-12-15|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*December 27th - '''Entropiq''' sign [[mwlky]]. <ref name="+mwlky">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1740040032386228643|title=We are happy to welcome @mwlkycs to our CS2 team! Welcome to our world!|date=2023-12-27|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>

|content5=
*March 31st - '''Entropiq''' bench [[c0llins]], [[Oxygen]] and [[mwlky]]. <ref name="2024 bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1774468796616454600|title=As of today, we are benching @mwlkycs, @oxygenncs and @c0llinsCS as Entropiq is preparing for next part of the season and exploring options for our roster|date=2024-03-31|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*April 24th - [[c0llins]] is acquired by [[iNation]]. <ref name="-c0llins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Entropiqteam/status/1783149030710620643|title=Today we are saying goodbye to Luka @c0llinsCS Živanović|date=2024-04-24|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*May 1st - '''Entropiq''' acquire [[Buzz]] and [[regali]] from [[Astralis]] and [[OG]], respectively, and sign [[FASHR]]. <ref name="2024 roster change">{{cite web|url=https://www.entropiq.gg/blog/cs2-we-are-stepping-up-our-game/|title=CS2: We are stepping up our game|date=2024-05-01|publisher='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*May 20th - [[Oxygen]] is acquired by [[500]]. <ref name="-Oxygen">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Entropiqteam/status/1792548754555318678|title=Today we say farewell to @oxygenncs as he embarks on a new journey with @500esports|date=2024-05-20|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*June 21st - '''Entropiq''' bench their roster. <ref name="bench 2024">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Entropiqteam/status/1804221399068024985|title=After careful consideration, we’ve made difficult decision to place our CS2 roster on the bench|date=2024-06-21|author='''Entropiq'''}}</ref>
*July 1st - '''Entropiq''' release [[mwlky]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-mwlky">{{inside source|date=2024-07-14|source=mwlky}}</ref>
*August 19th - [[Marix]] is acquired by [[FAVBET Team]]. <ref name="-Marix">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/favbet_team/status/1825503225694318818|title=@marixcs2 joins our active roster!|date=2024-08-19|author=[[FAVBET Team]]}}</ref>
*September 5th - '''Entropiq''' release [[tiziaN]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-tiziaN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/tizianCS/status/1831716088352022678|title=My contract with Entropiq has ended, and I’m currently supporting REVENANT with their team|date=2024-09-05|author=[[tiziaN]]}}</ref>
*September 9th - [[enkay J]] is aquired by [[ENCE]]. <ref name="-enkay">{{cite web|url=https://ence.gg/blogs/news/welcome-new-head-coach-enkay-j/|title=Welcome new Head Coach, enkay J|date=2024-09-09|publisher=[[ENCE]]}}</ref>
*September 23rd - [[Buzz]] is acquired by [[OG]]. <ref name="-buzz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/OGcsgo/status/1838208559034601959|title=We’re excited to officially welcome Christian "Buzz" Andersen to our roster following his stand-in period|date=2024-09-23|author=[[OG]]}}</ref>
*October 1st - '''Entropiq''' release [[regali]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-regali">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/regali_cs/status/1841110895394537525|title=Grateful to have been part of @Entropiqteam, now it's time to find a new home|date=2024-10-01|author=[[regali]]}}</ref>
*October 2nd - '''Entropiq''' release [[FASHR]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-fashr">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/itsFASHR/status/1841405227766841377|title=FREE AGENT|date=2024-10-02|author=[[FASHR]]}}</ref>
